{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/0863474/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山のコメント！\nありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/0863474/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はじめての方、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりの方、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもの方、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントを見ながら、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『あっ！この人は今度のイベントで来てくれるんだなー？』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『あっ！この人はまだ、とうぶん会えないのかぁ......(*_*)』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とかとか、思いながらコメント読ませていただいております"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/0863474/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/0863474/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！七夕のイベントは約8000人もの方が御越しくださったみたいでビックリです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/0863474/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8000人もの方が、乃木坂イベントのために来てくださったって！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやーそれはそれはすごく嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/0863474/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/0863474/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがたいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/0863474/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんにはほんとーにほんとーに感謝してます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、私の支えです。\n正直、 皆さんがいないと頑張れないです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/0863474/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次の大阪のイベントをとても楽しみにしてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/0863474/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんに幸せな気持ちでかえってもらうため、また来たい！\nってもらうため、全力つくして頑張ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/0863474/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂はチーム力！ものすごく素晴らしいので、それもいかして、素晴らしいステージ！\nイベントにしたいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/0863474/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/0863474/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/0863474/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんでほんで、\n今日！\nあしゅか、ひなぴょん、まあやの三人で行動してたんですよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたら、\n齊藤\n『なんか、家電やさんいきたい』\n川後&和田\n『なんで？』\n齊藤\n『なんか、見てると楽しいじゃん！』\n川後\n『あっ！なんかわかるかも！\n食器洗うやつあるじゃん？\nあの、水ので方とかすき！』\n和田\n『なるほど、私は、マッサージ機のあの絶妙な動きは素晴らしい！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"などなど、ひたすらしゃべってました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どーでもいい話をすみませぇん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/0863474/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/0863474/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はみなみが家に泊まりに来た"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/0863474/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日、学校なのに......寝るのが遅くて、起きるのが早そうな予感がする......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/0863474/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/0863474/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この予感はきっと当たってしまうだろう........."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/0863474/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/0863474/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/0863474/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/0863474/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家電は好きですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！家電の話や、お泊まりの話、握手会の話......(*_*)\nいったいなんのはなしをしたかったんだろー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/0863474/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/0863474/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/0863474/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bye"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/0863474/0004.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}